    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="52">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 52</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="52" corresp="#wit-g-a">Gif hwa wudewan nydnæme, gebete þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> be were.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="52" corresp="#wit-a">Gif hwa wudewan nydnæme, gebete þæt be were.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="52" corresp="#wit-q">Si quis uiduam per uim capiat, wéra emendet.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="52" corresp="#wit-b">Be wydewan. Gyf hwa wuduwan nydnæme, gebete þæt be his were.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">Concerning widows. If anyone does violence to a widow, he shall make amends by the payment of his wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">(Von Wittwen. B) Wenn einer eine Wittwe gewaltsam ehelicht, büsse er das mit (seinem B) Wergeld.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">(Of widows. B) If anyone takes a widow by force, let him make amends for it with (his, B) wergild.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
